# Grip: blow-off pump (DO1) off, vacuum pump (DO0) on, then wait up to `timeout` for vacuum
# achieved (DI0 = 1, debounced). Success -> pump stays on (state HOLDING).
# Timeout -> pump off, error_code NO_VACUUM. Cancel -> pump off, CANCELLED.
# Already HOLDING with vacuum -> immediate SUCCESS, no I/O switched. Seconds.
float64 timeout                 # s; 0 -> config grip_timeout
---
bool success
GripperErrorCode error_code     # machine-readable reason (SUCCESS = 1)
string message                  # human-readable reason
float64 time_to_vacuum          # s from pump on to vacuum achieved (seal quality hint); -1 if not achieved
---
float64 elapsed                 # s since the vacuum pump was switched on
